A roadmap of our proof. The orange boxes are preliminaries, and the blue-green boxes are the meat of the proof address in Section~\ref{sec:proof}. All probabilities are over the random choice of evaluation points $\alpha_1,\dots,\alpha_n$ for our Reed--Solomon code.
}\label{fig:roadmap}
